+# large varied sample
+
+this fixture exercises tab navigation with files that do not all read like generated modules.
+
+- auth/session.ts: updates the session window with cold-start behavior.
+- billing/invoice-rules.ts: updates the invoice batch with warm-path behavior.
+- search/query-planner.ts: updates the query graph with operator-mode behavior.
+- sync/retry-policy.ts: updates the retry lane with shared-cache behavior.
+- ui/diff-panel.tsx: updates the diff viewport with terminal-safe behavior.
+- ui/keyboard-shortcuts.ts: updates the shortcut map with audit-ready behavior.
+- data/customer-rollup.sql: updates the customer ledger with high-volume behavior.
+- data/migrations/20260426_add_audit_events.sql: updates the audit stream with quiet-default behavior.
+- docs/release-runbook.md: updates the release checklist with cold-start behavior.
+- docs/support-playbook.md: updates the support escalation with warm-path behavior.
+- config/routes.yaml: updates the route table with operator-mode behavior.
+- config/feature-flags.json: updates the flag registry with shared-cache behavior.
+- packages/cli/commands/review.ts: updates the review command with terminal-safe behavior.
+- packages/cli/commands/export.ts: updates the export command with audit-ready behavior.
+- packages/render/line-layout.ts: updates the line measurement with high-volume behavior.
+- packages/render/theme-tokens.ts: updates the theme palette with quiet-default behavior.
+- test/session-cache.test.ts: updates the cache behavior with cold-start behavior.
+- test/query-planner.test.ts: updates the planner branch with warm-path behavior.
+- scripts/collect-metrics.ts: updates the metrics collector with operator-mode behavior.
+- scripts/prune-preview-artifacts.ts: updates the artifact pruner with shared-cache behavior.
+- examples/api-client.ts: updates the client example with terminal-safe behavior.
+- examples/glimpse-theme.ts: updates the theme example with audit-ready behavior.
+- storybook/diff-panel.stories.tsx: updates the panel story with high-volume behavior.
+- storybook/navigation.stories.tsx: updates the navigation story with quiet-default behavior.
